+<p><b>42</b> (<b>forty-two</b>) is the <a href="/wiki/Natural_number" title="Natural number">natural number</a> immediately following <a href="/wiki/41_(number)" title="41 (number)">41</a> and directly preceding <a href="/wiki/43_(number)" title="43 (number)">43</a>. The number has received considerable attention in popular culture as a result of its central appearance in <i><a href="/wiki/The_Hitchhiker%27s_Guide_to_the_Galaxy" title="The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy">The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy</a></i> as the "<a href="/wiki/Phrases_from_The_Hitchhiker%27s_Guide_to_the_Galaxy#Answer_to_the_Ultimate_Question_of_Life.2C_the_Universe.2C_and_Everything_.2842.29" title="Phrases from The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy">Answer to The Ultimate Question of Life, the Universe, and Everything</a>".</p>
